{"type":"message","id":"d1718a27","parentId":"0ead1ab2","timestamp":"2026-02-10T17:50:51.347Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"chatcmpl-tool-e69cff3a9e0d4080833248e56f955611","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.9 (96c46ed) — WhatsApp automation without the \"please accept our new privacy policy\".\n\nUsage: openclaw models [options] [command]\n\nModel discovery, scanning, and configuration\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>     Agent id to inspect (overrides\n                   OPENCLAW_AGENT_DIR/PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR)\n  -h, --help       display help for command\n  --status-json    Output JSON (alias for `models status --json`) (default:\n                   false)\n  --status-plain   Plain output (alias for `models status --plain`) (default:\n                   false)\n\nCommands:\n  aliases          Manage model aliases\n  auth             Manage model auth profiles\n  fallbacks        Manage model fallback list\n  image-fallbacks  Manage image model fallback list\n  list             List models (configured by default)\n  scan             Scan OpenRouter free models for tools + images\n  set              Set the default model\n  set-image        Set the image model\n  status           Show configured model state\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/models"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":4213,"aggregated":"🦞 OpenClaw 2026.2.9 (96c46ed) — WhatsApp automation without the \"please accept our new privacy policy\".\n\nUsage: openclaw models [options] [command]\n\nModel discovery, scanning, and configuration\n\nOptions:\n  --agent <id>     Agent id to inspect (overrides\n                   OPENCLAW_AGENT_DIR/PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR)\n  -h, --help       display help for command\n  --status-json    Output JSON (alias for `models status --json`) (default:\n                   false)\n  --status-plain   Plain output (alias for `models status --plain`) (default:\n                   false)\n\nCommands:\n  aliases          Manage model aliases\n  auth             Manage model auth profiles\n  fallbacks        Manage model fallback list\n  image-fallbacks  Manage image model fallback list\n  list             List models (configured by default)\n  scan             Scan OpenRouter free models for tools + images\n  set              Set the default model\n  set-image        Set the image model\n  status           Show configured model state\n\nDocs: https://docs.openclaw.ai/cli/models","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770745851345}}
