{"type":"message","id":"ee0d3f6c","parentId":"e0cb0360","timestamp":"2026-02-10T17:51:22.978Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good! The gateway is running and listening on port 18789. The RPC probe is ok. So the system is operational.\n\nNow, I've completed the task:\n1. ✅ Started a fresh session by setting the default model to Kimi K2.5\n2. ✅ Confirmed the model is active (default is now moonshotai/kimi-k2.5)\n3. ✅ Verified the gateway is running\n\nI should provide a clear summary of what was accomplished. Since this is a subagent, I need to return a concise but informative final response to the main agent.\n\nLet me also check if there's anything about \"fresh session\" that might require more than just setting the default model. Perhaps starting the gateway if it wasn't running? But it's already running.\n\nI should note that while the model is configured, actual API calls to Kimi K2.5 would require proper authentication (API key). The system shows \"Missing auth - moonshotai\" which means we'd need to configure credentials. But the task was to start a session and confirm the model is active, which I've done.\n\nLet me craft a final response.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"**Task Completed:** NVIDIA Kimi K2.5 model session started and confirmed active.\n\n**Actions Taken:**\n1. ✅ Set default model to `moonshotai/kimi-k2.5` using `openclaw models set`\n2. ✅ Verified configuration change - default model now shows as `moonshotai/kimi-k2.5` in `openclaw models status`\n3. ✅ Confirmed gateway is running and operational (listening on port 18789)\n\n**Current Status:**\n- Default model: **moonshotai/kimi-k2.5** (Kimi K2.5)\n- Model is properly configured and aliased in the system\n- Gateway service is active and ready\n\n**Note:** The Kimi K2.5 model configuration is in place, but API authentication would need to be configured via `openclaw configure` to make actual API calls. The session is ready to use Kimi K2.5 once credentials are provided."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"stepfun/step-3.5-flash:free","usage":{"input":11981,"output":710,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12691,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1770745879503}}
